---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Capabilities - Sthenos">
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Sthenos</a>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/drill">Drill</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="section" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516849841032-87cbac4d0383?w=1920&q=80');">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">01_capabilities.html</p>
      <h1>System Capabilities</h1>
      <p>The six core capabilities that transform raw data into strategic intelligence. Each capability represents a transformation stage. Data flows from ingestion through enrichment, inference, classification, and finally to a WISDOM-aligned decision signal.</p>
      <div class="stats">
        <div>
          <div class="stat-value">118</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Entities Processed</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="stat-value">&lt;500ms</div>
          <div class="stat-label">P95 Latency</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="pipeline-full">
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">01</span>
        <span>Data Ingestion</span>
      </div>
      <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">02</span>
        <span>Feature Enrichment</span>
      </div>
      <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">03</span>
        <span>Behavioral Inference</span>
      </div>
      <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">04</span>
        <span>Role Classification</span>
      </div>
      <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">05</span>
        <span>Decision Signal</span>
      </div>
      <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
      <div class="pipe-stage">
        <span class="pipe-num">06</span>
        <span>Evaluation</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div>
        <h3>End-to-End Latency &lt; 500ms</h3>
        <p>P95 for 100 entities through full pipeline. Sufficient for real-time tactical decision support.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Dual Inference Paths</h3>
        <p>Static (scene-level) and Streaming (per-timestep) run in parallel, enabling both batch evaluation and live tracking.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>WISDOM Contract</h3>
        <p>Output schema is v1 stable — no breaking changes to L3 interface without deprecation notice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  nav a {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.17px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-section {
    background: var(--space-black);
    padding: 80px 5%;
  }

  .pipeline-full {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pipe-stage {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--ghost-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ghost-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }

  .pipe-num {
    font-size: 10px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .pipe-arrow {
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>